    {
      "source": "Creates an underscore-aware <code>Tuple</code> wrapper applying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/JdbcUtils.html#convertPropertyNameToUnderscoreName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>JdbcUtils.convertPropertyNameToUnderscoreName(String)</code></a>\nconversion to leniently look up properties from query results whose columns follow snake-case syntax.",
      "translation": "创建一个对下划线敏感的 <code>Tuple</code> 包装器，应用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/support/JdbcUtils.html#convertPropertyNameToUnderscoreName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>JdbcUtils.convertPropertyNameToUnderscoreName(String)</code></a> 转换，以便宽松地从查询结果中查找属性，这些查询结果的列遵循蛇形命名法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>key</code> - the key for which to get the value from the map.",
      "translation": "<code>key</code> - 从映射中获取该键对应的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
