      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the key is not a <code>String</code> or not a key of the backing <code>Tuple</code> this returns <code>false</code>. Otherwise\nthis returns <code>true</code> even when the value from the backing <code>Tuple</code> is <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "如果键不是<code>String</code>或不是底层<code>Tuple</code>的键，则返回<code>false</code>。否则，即使底层<code>Tuple</code>中的值为<code>null</code>，也返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the key is not a <code>String</code> or not a key of the backing <code>Tuple</code> this returns <code>null</code>. Otherwise\nthe value from the backing <code>Tuple</code> is returned, which also might be <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "如果键不是 `<code>String</code>` 或不是底层 `<code>Tuple</code>` 的键，则返回 `<code>null</code>`。否则，返回来自底层 `<code>Tuple</code>` 的值，该值也可能为 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> implementation which delegates all calls to a <code>Tuple</code>. Depending on the provided <code>Tuple</code>\nimplementation it might return the same value for various keys of which only one will appear in the key/entry set.",
      "translation": "一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>实现，它将所有调用委托给一个<code>Tuple</code>。根据所提供的<code>Tuple</code>实现，它可能会为多个键返回相同的值，其中只有一个键会出现在键/条目集合中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the key is not a <code>String</code> or not a key of the backing <code>Tuple</code> this returns <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "如果键不是<code>String</code>或不是底层<code>Tuple</code>的键，则返回<code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
